      "value": "The following issue has been occurring frequently recently, requiring frequent and immediate restarts. However, due to EAC, the restart process takes longer, which is making things difficult for me.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/android-vrchat-audio-mute-suddenly",
